01:12:17.364 --> 01:12:18.695
(GAVEL BANGING)


01:12:18.865 --> 01:12:21.834
JUDGE: Ladies and
gentlemen, at this stage
of the proceedings


01:12:21.935 --> 01:12:24.802
the counsels are ready
for their opening statements.


01:12:25.338 --> 01:12:28.364
For the prosecution,
Mr. Roberts will proceed


01:12:28.508 --> 01:12:30.806
