statement first.


01:12:31.277 --> 01:12:35.145
Mr. Roberts,
are you ready to proceed?


01:12:36.750 --> 01:12:38.377
Yes, Your Honor.


01:12:42.455 --> 01:12:45.015
Ladies and gentlemen
of the jury,


01:12:49.396 --> 01:12:52.832
the state will show
and you will hear


01:12:53.400 --> 01:12:56.267
that Frank Lucas
is the most dangerous man


01:12:57.337 --> 01:12:59.635
walking the streets
of our city.


01:13:02.375 --> 01:13:06.277
All right, y'all,
get on out. Let me talk to
Mr. Richie alone.


01:13:09.382 --> 01:13:12.783
Come on, come on, come on.
I pay y'all by the hour,
not by the minute.


01:13:15.588 --> 01:13:16.919
Thank you.


01:13:21.561 --> 01:13:23.791
You ain't wearing a wire,
are you?


01:13:24.597 --> 01:13:25.621
No.


01:13:26.800 --> 01:13:27.858
All right.


01:13:27.967 --> 01:13:32.301
I was talking to my lawyers.
They said something to me,
I can't believe it.


01:13:33.773 --> 01:13:36.970
Did you really find
a million dollars in
the trunk of a car


01:13:37.110 --> 01:13:38.805
