Did you do that?
Yeah.


01:13:38.945 --> 01:13:40.310
You did that for real, huh?


01:13:40.447 --> 01:13:43.644
My man. Good for you. Shit.


01:13:43.783 --> 01:13:45.876
You know Johnny Law got,
though, right?


01:13:46.086 --> 01:13:48.077
About it, Mr. Richie.


01:13:48.188 --> 01:13:50.418
You know he got it.
You turned that money in,


01:13:50.523 --> 01:13:53.048
he took it and you ain't
get nothing for it. Did you?


01:13:53.159 --> 01:13:54.592
Why did you do that?


01:13:54.994 --> 01:13:57.326
It was the right thing to do.
That's true.


01:13:57.764 --> 01:13:59.732
That's a good answer.
It was the right thing to do.


01:13:59.866 --> 01:14:02.061
The question I have,
the question I've been
asking myself is,


01:14:02.168 --> 01:14:03.760
would you do it again?


01:14:05.038 --> 01:14:07.939
I mean, that's a lot of money,
that's a long time ago.


01:14:08.374 --> 01:14:11.901
Many car payments ago,
many child support
payments ago.


01:14:13.680 --> 01:14:17.514
So I said to myself,
the onlyest way to find out
is to find out.


01:14:19.052 --> 01:14:24.820
RICHIE: Bribery, extortion,
murder, racketeering...


01:14:26.793 --> 01:14:28.522
<i>FRANK: Now,
you give me an address,</i>


01:14:28.661 --> 01:14:31.926
I'll make sure the
car's there, I'll make sure
that money's in that trunk.


01:14:32.031 --> 01:14:33.430
No, thanks.


01:14:33.800 --> 01:14:35.097
You sure?


01:14:36.903 --> 01:14:39.804
Come on, now, Richie.
What do you think,
that impresses me?


01:14:40.006 --> 01:14:42.975
You think that you're better
than them? You ain't no better
than them other cops.


01:14:43.076 --> 01:14:45.306
In fact, you're the same
as them. You are them.


01:14:46.045 --> 01:14:47.376
Let me ask you this.


01:14:47.514 --> 01:14:50.642
Do you really think that
putting me behind bars


01:14:50.750 --> 01:14:52.650
is going to change
anything on them streets?


01:14:52.752 --> 01:14:54.379
Them dope fiends
is gonna shoot it,


01:14:54.487 --> 01:14:56.614
they're gonna steal for it,
they're gonna die for it.


01:14:56.723 --> 01:14:59.487
Putting me in or out
ain't gonna change one thing.


01:14:59.859 --> 01:15:01.121
Then that's the way it is.


01:15:01.227 --> 01:15:03.058
That's just the way it is.
So what we got, Richie?


01:15:03.263 --> 01:15:05.026
We got me and you
sitting here.


01:15:05.331 --> 01:15:08.232
<i>We got that little snitch-ass
driver for my brother.</i>


01:15:08.334 --> 01:15:09.801
<i>You got a little
bit of powder.</i>


01:15:10.103 --> 01:15:11.968
<i>You're going to need
more than that, Richie.</i>


01:15:12.238 --> 01:15:15.730
<i>RICHIE: I got possession,
supply, conspiracy,</i>


01:15:15.942 --> 01:15:20.038
<i>bribing a law officer. I got
people who'll attest to seeing
you kill in cold blood.</i>


01:15:20.180 --> 01:15:24.082
I got your offshore bank
accounts, your real estate,
your businesses,


01:15:24.217 --> 01:15:26.685
all bought with money
from heroin.


01:15:27.020 --> 01:15:29.750
And I got hundreds of
parents of dead kids.


01:15:30.190 --> 01:15:32.681
Addicts who OD'ed on
your product. And that's
my story for the jury.


01:15:32.792 --> 01:15:36.353
And that's how I make
it all stick. "This man
murdered thousands of people.


01:15:36.462 --> 01:15:38.430
"And he did it
from a penthouse,
driving a Lincoln."


01:15:38.565 --> 01:15:40.362
Aside from that,
you got nothing
to worry about.


01:15:40.466 --> 01:15:43.333
That's pretty good.
But that's why we go to
court, isn't it, Richie?


01:15:43.436 --> 01:15:44.869
'Cause I got witnesses, too.


01:15:45.104 --> 01:15:49.063
I got celebrities.
I got sports figures.
I got Harlem, Richie.


01:15:49.609 --> 01:15:53.409
I took care of Harlem, so
Harlem's gonna take care
of me. You can believe that.


01:15:53.546 --> 01:15:56.014
I got more than that, Frank.
What you got?


01:15:56.115 --> 01:15:58.777
I've got a line of people
wanting to testify
against you,


01:15:58.918 --> 01:16:01.250
it stretches out the door
and around the block.


01:16:01.387 --> 01:16:05.187
<i>You damaged a lot of lives,
Frank. I got the Mazzano
crime family.</i>


01:16:05.291 --> 01:16:06.883
<i>Remember those boys?
You put them out of business.</i>


01:16:06.993 --> 01:16:08.551
I ain't got nothing to do
with no Mazzanos.


01:16:08.661 --> 01:16:09.719
Mazzanos ain't got nothing
to do with me.


01:16:09.829 --> 01:16:11.228
They got everything
to do with you.
What, they...


01:16:11.331 --> 01:16:12.389
You know why?
Why?


01:16:12.498 --> 01:16:15.058
Because apart from the fact
that they hate you personally,


01:16:15.568 --> 01:16:16.899
they hate what you represent.


01:16:17.003 --> 01:16:20.063
I don't represent nothing
but Frank Lucas.
You sure?


01:16:20.473 --> 01:16:22.407
A black businessman like you?


01:16:22.842 --> 01:16:24.366
You represent progress.


01:16:25.111 --> 01:16:28.103
The kind of progress
that's going to see them
lose a lot of money.


01:16:28.681 --> 01:16:32.242
With you out of the way,
everything can return
to normal.


01:16:33.386 --> 01:16:34.614
My man.


01:16:39.459 --> 01:16:41.450
You know what normal
is to me, Richie?


01:16:41.761 --> 01:16:44.662
I ain't seen normal since
I was six years old.


01:16:46.299 --> 01:16:48.893
Normal is seeing the police
right up to my house


01:16:49.002 --> 01:16:51.937
dragging my little
12-year-old cousin out,
tying him to a pole,


01:16:52.038 --> 01:16:55.166
shoving a shotgun in his mouth
so hard they bust his teeth.


01:16:55.308 --> 01:16:58.573
Then they bust two shotgun
shells in his head and
knock his fucking head off.


01:16:58.678 --> 01:16:59.906
That's what normal is to me.


01:17:00.013 --> 01:17:03.073
I didn't give a fuck
about no police then.


01:17:03.182 --> 01:17:06.151
I don't give a fuck about
no police now. Shit.


01:17:06.519 --> 01:17:08.749
You know what, you can do
whatever you want to do.


01:17:08.888 --> 01:17:11.356
So, it don't mean nothing
to me for you to show up
tomorrow morning


01:17:11.491 --> 01:17:13.959
with your head blown off.
Do you understand
what I'm saying?


01:17:14.494 --> 01:17:16.860
Yeah, Frank. Get in line.


01:17:17.530 --> 01:17:19.760
That one stretches
around the block, too.


01:17:23.169 --> 01:17:24.500
All right.


01:17:28.241 --> 01:17:29.674
What do you want to do?


01:17:36.382 --> 01:17:38.043
You know what you got to do.


01:17:38.217 --> 01:17:39.980
What do you want me to do?
Snitch, huh?


01:17:40.086 --> 01:17:41.553
I know you don't want me
to give up no cops.


01:17:41.688 --> 01:17:43.155
What do you want?
You want gangsters?


01:17:43.756 --> 01:17:47.351
Pick one. Jew gangsters?
Mick gangsters? Guineas?


01:17:48.027 --> 01:17:50.825
They've been bleeding
Harlem dry since they got
off the boat, Richie.


01:17:50.930 --> 01:17:54.730
I don't give a fuck
about no crime figures.
You can have them.


01:17:55.735 --> 01:17:57.168
I'll take them, too.


01:17:57.437 --> 01:17:59.337
You'll take them, too?


01:18:04.510 --> 01:18:08.173
No, you didn't.
You're talking about police.
You want police?


01:18:08.748 --> 01:18:09.874
You want your own kind?


01:18:09.983 --> 01:18:11.245
They're not my kind.


01:18:12.018 --> 01:18:14.578
They're in business with you,
Frank. They ain't my kind.


01:18:14.854 --> 01:18:18.756
They ain't my kind
like the Italians are
not yours. All right?


01:18:21.761 --> 01:18:22.750
Huh.


01:18:32.338 --> 01:18:34.704
What can you
promise me, Richie?


01:18:37.744 --> 01:18:40.713
I can promise you,
you lie about one name,


01:18:41.080 --> 01:18:42.809
you'll never
get out of prison.


01:18:43.282 --> 01:18:48.379
You lie about one dollar, in
one offshore account, you'll
never get out of prison.


01:18:49.355 --> 01:18:53.587
Now you can live life
rich in jail for the rest
of your born days,


01:18:54.260 --> 01:18:56.319
or be poor outside
for some of them.


01:18:57.597 --> 01:18:59.895
That's what I can promise you.


01:19:02.802 --> 01:19:09.503
I want them cops, Richie.
That's what I want,
I want them cops


01:19:10.443 --> 01:19:13.378
that took that money
out of my pockets.


01:19:16.382 --> 01:19:17.508
Him, too.


01:19:17.950 --> 01:19:19.611
All right. Okay.


01:19:21.821 --> 01:19:23.914
Hey, Spearman? Spearman.


01:19:24.724 --> 01:19:27.284
So these guys are
all connected up
to Gywnn, all right.


01:19:27.427 --> 01:19:30.021
See this guy here,
he's in uniform...


01:19:30.797 --> 01:19:33.129
<i>NEWSCASTER 1:
Four police officers
were arrested today</i>


01:19:33.266 --> 01:19:35.791
<i>on charges of taking bribes
from drug traffickers.</i>


01:19:35.935 --> 01:19:37.129
MAN: Well done, Jimmy.


01:19:37.236 --> 01:19:39.363
<i>NEWSCASTER 2:
The investigation
into police corruption</i>


01:19:39.472 --> 01:19:42.600
<i>has swept through New York's
drug enforcement ranks</i>


01:19:42.742 --> 01:19:46.143
<i>broadened today with
the arrest of 19
more officers.</i>


01:19:47.180 --> 01:19:50.877
<i>NEWSCASTER 3: In what is being
called this city's largest
police corruption scandal,</i>


01:19:50.983 --> 01:19:55.147
<i>32 more officers were indicted
today in federal court
on bribery charges.</i>


01:19:55.321 --> 01:19:58.449
<i>NEWSCASTER 4:
These police officers will
face stiff prison terms,</i>


01:19:58.591 --> 01:20:01.458
<i>say federal prosecutors,
if found guilty.</i>


01:20:01.594 --> 01:20:04.062
<i>NEWSCASTER 5: A report
by federal investigators
into New York's</i>


01:20:04.163 --> 01:20:06.256
<i>everwidening police
corruption scandal</i>


01:20:06.365 --> 01:20:08.993
<i>claims that more than
half of the city's officers</i>


01:20:09.135 --> 01:20:13.162
<i>assigned to drug enforcement
have engaged in some form
of corruption.</i>


01:20:14.307 --> 01:20:17.606
<i>NEWSCASTER 6:
Allegations of widespread
corruption within</i>


01:20:17.710 --> 01:20:20.178
<i>the elite narcotics squad SIU</i>


01:20:20.313 --> 01:20:23.146
<i>have led to the arrest of
more New York City detectives.</i>


01:20:24.050 --> 01:20:25.312
<i>NEWSCASTER 7:
Convicted of extortion,</i>


01:20:25.451 --> 01:20:28.682
<i>members of New York City's
Special Investigations
Narcotics Unit</i>


01:20:28.821 --> 01:20:31.847
<i>will face sentencing
today in federal court.</i>


01:20:33.793 --> 01:20:36.694
FRANK: MacNamara. Vendazzo.


01:20:37.897 --> 01:20:39.194
Trupo.


01:20:42.502 --> 01:20:43.935
You are special.


01:21:20.239 --> 01:21:21.263
(GROANS)


01:21:27.346 --> 01:21:29.211
It's good work, Frank.


01:21:30.516 --> 01:21:31.881
You know...


01:21:32.084 --> 01:21:35.713
You don't want a drink
or something? Celebrate?


01:21:36.322 --> 01:21:37.721
You got any holy water?


01:22:33.879 --> 01:22:35.938
Check your property.
Sign, please.


